      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "666fe4d60d07b25d5df8",
    "source": "For a feature with choices.",
    "sourceHash": "666fe4d60d07b25d5df871b682f2898bfc1a90e383d7c0e51a6d6a69f56310ce",
    "kinds": [
      "display-property"
    ],
    "sites": [
      {
        "file": "src/lib/dm/catalog-party.ts",
        "line": 354,
        "property": "help"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "309b218bdd2e4cb07911",
    "source": "For a gem, an art object or anything the book does not price: its sale and a spell's costly material read it. Leave the worth out of the name.",
    "sourceHash": "309b218bdd2e4cb079116d19ec15ede8c7f33f6a362fe7c240b9cf52af98e859",
    "kinds": [
      "display-property"
    ],
    "sites": [
      {
        "file": "src/lib/dm/catalog-party.ts",
        "line": 47,
        "property": "help"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "f5c726f5e841a82aa0d2",
    "source": "For a hoard or a defeated foe's loot, call roll_treasure with the challenge's CR instead of inventing a gold figure: the server rolls the coin value, splits it among the party, and moves the gold, then tells you how many magic items to hand out with grant_item. For an overland journey, call travel with the hours (or the miles) and the pace: the server reports the miles covered (4, 3 or 2 an hour, half in difficult terrain) and the pace's effect on watchfulness and stealth, and rolls the forced-march Constitution saves that tire the party past 8 hours. To resolve breaking a door, chest, or rope, call damage_object with its material and size: the server reads its AC and HP from the book, remembers the damage a named object has already taken, and tells you whether it gives way; for a character's weapon blow pass characterId and weapon and the server rolls the attack and the damage. Do not decide loot value, march fatigue, or whether an object breaks by feel when these tools settle it.",
    "sourceHash": "f5c726f5e841a82aa0d282432ab8b33336e475e49db9807d22817076345a0577",
    "kinds": [
      "display-property"
    ],
    "sites": [
      {
        "file": "src/lib/dm/prompt-rules.ts",
        "line": 147,
        "property": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "e0132fc234fd58155e72",
    "source": "For a material priced per one (Astral Projection, Create Undead, Imprisonment).",
    "sourceHash": "e0132fc234fd58155e723fd9de919aeda3eb3df051382ede98f8a54cd6688b06",
    "kinds": [
      "display-property"
    ],
    "sites": [
