        "line": 505,
        "property": "help"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "be3b09d4751947987f39",
    "source": "For a spell the server does not know, so a jump past its range is refused.",
    "sourceHash": "be3b09d4751947987f39884cfcbf31cd0675a60dd380248c39188a058e8a5fc3",
    "kinds": [
      "display-property"
    ],
    "sites": [
      {
        "file": "src/lib/dm/catalog-board.ts",
        "line": 149,
        "property": "help"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "023085e43ae0f426fcdf",
    "source": "For a spell with a choice: the chosen option, or the beast or creature made ('wolf', 'skeleton'). They are Enlarge/Reduce, Protection from Energy's damage type, Enhance Ability's effect, Fire Shield's warm or chill, Polymorph's or Animal Shapes' beast, True Polymorph's or Shapechange's creature, and a summoning spell's creature: Conjure Animals 'wolf', Animate Dead 'skeleton' or 'reassert control', Giant Insect 'spider', Find Steed 'warhorse' or 'fey warhorse', Animate Objects 'tiny'.",
    "sourceHash": "023085e43ae0f426fcdf0ae0f3cf3710127cb16a583c85f19dc14f521ce5707f",
    "kinds": [
      "display-property"
    ],
    "sites": [
      {
        "file": "src/lib/dm/cast-tools.ts",
        "line": 185,
        "property": "description"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "4ca3d44149962c00befb",
    "source": "For a verb that is not one of its attacks: what kind of act it is (move for a retreat or a dash). It picks the board's badge.",
